{"seq":3,"slug":"hyperbolic-knots","title":"双曲纽结","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/structure/hyperbolic-knots","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"双曲纽结\">双曲纽结</h1><p>八字结的补空间能装进双曲空间，恰好可以用两个理想正四面体拼成，总体积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0299</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0299</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0299</span></span></span></span></span>。这个数字不是随便算出来的近似——它是八字结<strong>内在的、唯一的</strong>几何量，任何等价于八字结的纽结都会算出同一个体积。上一篇的几何化三分法告诉我们：绝大多数纽结都是双曲纽结，补空间携带一个完备双曲结构。这一篇要讲的，是为什么这个几何结构是唯一的、由此产生了哪些强得惊人的不变量，以及 2021 年机器学习如何在这片土地上发现了新数学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-补空间的双曲结构\">核心概念：补空间的双曲结构</h2><p>一个纽结是<strong>双曲纽结</strong>，指它的补空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>∖</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^3 \\setminus K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 上存在一个完备的、有限体积的<strong>双曲结构</strong>——即局部处处像双曲空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{H}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（常曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）的几何。八字结是最简单的双曲纽结；三叶结不是（它是环面纽结，见<a href=\"knot-complement\">补空间</a>）。双曲空间与欧氏几何的一个关键差别是它「装得下更多」：补空间可以剖分成有限个<strong>理想四面体</strong>（顶点落在无穷远的双曲四面体），把它们的体积加起来就是补空间的双曲体积。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[双曲纽结补空间] --&gt; B[剖分成理想四面体]&#10;    B --&gt; C[解双曲结构方程 Thurston 胶合]&#10;    C --&gt; D[得完备双曲度量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Mostow 刚性&lt;br/&gt;结构唯一]&#10;    E --&gt; F[双曲体积 Vol K]&#10;    E --&gt; G[尖点形状 / 最短测地线]&#10;    E --&gt; H[自然斜率&lt;br/&gt;DeepMind 2021 新不变量]&#10;    F --&gt; I[全部是纽结不变量]\">flowchart TD\n    A[双曲纽结补空间] --&gt; B[剖分成理想四面体]\n    B --&gt; C[解双曲结构方程 Thurston 胶合]\n    C --&gt; D[得完备双曲度量]\n    D --&gt; E[Mostow 刚性&lt;br/&gt;结构唯一]\n    E --&gt; F[双曲体积 Vol K]\n    E --&gt; G[尖点形状 / 最短测地线]\n    E --&gt; H[自然斜率&lt;br/&gt;DeepMind 2021 新不变量]\n    F --&gt; I[全部是纽结不变量]</pre><p>下表给几个双曲纽结的体积，感受这些数字作为「指纹」的分辨力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>纽结</th>\n<th>是否双曲</th>\n<th>双曲体积（近似）</th>\n<th>理想四面体数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三叶结 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否（环面结）</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八字结 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.02988</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.02988</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.02988</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.82812</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.82812</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.82812</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>6</mn><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.16396</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.16396</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.16396</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.13794</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.13794</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.13794</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mostow-刚性-几何变成不变量\">Mostow 刚性：几何变成不变量</h2><p>双曲结构之所以能当不变量，全靠 <strong>Mostow–Prasad 刚性定理</strong>：一个维数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>、有限体积的双曲流形，其双曲结构由拓扑（基本群）<strong>唯一确定</strong>。这与二维截然不同——二维曲面上双曲结构可以连续变形（有模空间），三维却「刚」得不能动分毫。</p>\n<p>这个刚性带来一个哲学上惊人的推论：对双曲纽结，<strong>几何量就是拓扑量</strong>。双曲体积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Vol}(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Vol</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、尖点（cusp，对应挖掉的纽结那根管在无穷远处的形状）的形状、最短闭测地线的长度、Chern–Simons 不变量——这些本该属于「度量」的连续数据，因为唯一性反而全都成了<a href=\"knot-complement\">补空间</a>乃至纽结的不变量。于是我们有了一族<strong>实数值</strong>不变量，分辨力极高：不同双曲纽结几乎总有不同体积，体积因此成为纽结表排序与查重的利器。Gordon–Luecke 定理保证补空间决定纽结，Mostow 刚性再保证补空间的几何被拓扑锁死，两者叠加，双曲几何就名正言顺地成了纽结不变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"snappy-把双曲几何算出来\">SnapPy：把双曲几何算出来</h2><p>双曲体积等量虽是实数、无法笔算，却能高精度<strong>数值</strong>计算，这让双曲纽结成为「实验数学」的乐园。事实上的标准工具是 <strong>SnapPy</strong>（Culler、Dunfield 等人开发，基于 Jeff Weeks 的 SnapPea 内核）：给它一张纽结图或 DT 码，它剖分补空间、解 Thurston 胶合方程、迭代出双曲结构，报告体积、尖点形状、对称群、测地线长度谱等。SnapPy 内置的<strong>尖点普查</strong>（Cusped Census）收录了所有能用不超过 10 个理想四面体三角剖分的纽结外部空间，其中 <code>CensusKnots</code> 有 3116 项；软件仍在活跃维护，2026 年 1 月发布 3.3 版、3 月发布 3.3.2 版（<a href=\"https://snappy.computop.org/censuses.html\">来源：SnapPy 3.3.2 文档, computop.org, 2026</a>）。这些工具算出的几何不变量，与 KnotInfo 里的组合与多项式不变量一起，构成了机器学习实验的数据底座，详见<a href=\"../practice/computational-knot\">计算纽结理论</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机器学习发现的新几何-自然斜率\">机器学习发现的新几何：自然斜率</h2><p>2021 年，DeepMind 与牛津大学 András Juhász、Marc Lackenby 及悉尼大学 Geordie Williamson 合作，把双曲纽结当成机器学习的实验田，做出了一件典型的「AI 辅助纯数学」工作。他们训练模型预测纽结的<strong>符号差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（一个来自<a href=\"../invariants/genus-crossing\">亏格与交叉数</a>的代数不变量），发现模型主要依赖的竟是补空间的<strong>几何</strong>特征，而非人们预期的代数特征。</p>\n<p>顺着模型的「注意力」，Lackenby 定义出一个此前无人注意的新实数不变量——双曲纽结的<strong>自然斜率</strong>（natural slope），并严格证明了一条不等式：两倍符号差与自然斜率之差，被一个常数乘以（双曲体积 / 单射半径的立方）所控制（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-021-03593-1\">来源：Davies, Juhász, Lackenby, Williamson, Nature, 2021</a>）。这是一个货真价实、由机器学习引导发现并由人类严格证明的新定理，把「不变量」章的代数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 与「结构」章的双曲几何真正焊在了一起。它也示范了本 hub「应用」章反复出现的主题：现代计算与 AI 不只是算得快，还能指出人类此前看漏的结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双曲纽结的补空间带完备有限体积双曲结构，可剖分成理想四面体；八字结是最简双曲纽结（体积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0299</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0299</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0299</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>Mostow–Prasad 刚性使三维双曲结构由拓扑唯一确定，于是体积、尖点形状、测地线长度等几何量全成纽结不变量。</li>\n<li>双曲体积是实数值、分辨力极高的不变量，几乎能区分所有双曲纽结。</li>\n<li>SnapPy（2026 年 3.3.2 版）数值求解双曲结构，其 CensusKnots 含 3116 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 四面体的纽结外部空间。</li>\n<li>2021 年 DeepMind 团队用机器学习引导，发现连接符号差与双曲几何的「自然斜率」新不变量并给出严格证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>三分法与双曲结构的来源：<a href=\"knot-complement\">补空间</a></li>\n<li>与自然斜率挂钩的符号差：<a href=\"../invariants/genus-crossing\">亏格与交叉数</a></li>\n<li>SnapPy/KnotInfo 与机器学习数据底座：<a href=\"../practice/computational-knot\">计算纽结理论</a></li>\n<li>唯一性建立在基本群之上：<a href=\"knot-group\">纽结群</a></li>\n<li>跨库：拓扑数据分析等几何计算方法见<a href=\"../../algebraic-topology/practice/topological-data-analysis\">代数拓扑 · 拓扑数据分析</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"双曲纽结","id":"双曲纽结"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：补空间的双曲结构","id":"核心概念-补空间的双曲结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Mostow 刚性：几何变成不变量","id":"mostow-刚性-几何变成不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"SnapPy：把双曲几何算出来","id":"snappy-把双曲几何算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"机器学习发现的新几何：自然斜率","id":"机器学习发现的新几何-自然斜率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"补空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/structure/knot-complement"},"next":{"title":"DNA 与生物","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/practice/knots-in-biology"}}